# Server-side only — do NOT prefix with VITE_. A VITE_ prefix tells Vite to
# inline the value into the shipped client bundle, which would defeat the
# entire point of this variable (it must never reach the browser).
#
# Used only by api/generate.ts (the Vercel serverless proxy) so the app can
# offer real Gemini output without every visitor supplying their own key.
# Set the real value in your Vercel project's Environment Variables — never
# commit it here or anywhere else in the repo.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
